sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client
    participant Redis
    participant MQProducer
    participant MQBroker
    participant MQConsumer
    participant Redis Listener

    Client->>Redis: 零钱锁单请求1
    Redis->>Redis: INCR UEWF_{merchantId}_{userId}
    Redis->>Redis: EXPIRE UEWF_{merchantId}_{userId} 5s
    Redis->>MQProducer: 延迟消息1
    MQProducer-->>MQBroker: 发送消息1
    MQProducer->>Client:锁单结果1

    Note over Client,MQProducer: 等待1s

    Client->>Redis: 充值1
    Redis->>Redis: GET UEWF_{merchantId}_{userId}
    Redis->>Client: 充值结果1

    Client->>Redis: 零钱锁单请求2
    Redis->>Redis: INCR UEWF_{merchantId}_{userId}
    Redis->>Redis: EXPIRE UEWF_{merchantId}_{userId} 5s
    Redis->>MQProducer: 延迟消息2
    MQProducer-->>MQBroker: 发送消息2
    MQProducer->>Client:锁单结果2

    Note over Client,MQProducer: 等待1s

    Client->>Redis: 充值2
    Redis->>Redis: GET UEWF_{merchantId}_{userId}
    Redis->>Client: 充值结果2

    Client->>Redis: 零钱锁单请求3
    Redis->>Redis: INCR UEWF_{merchantId}_{userId}
    Redis->>Redis: EXPIRE UEWF_{merchantId}_{userId} 5s
    Redis->>MQProducer: 延迟消息3
    MQProducer-->>MQBroker: 发送消息3
    MQProducer->>Client:锁单结果3

    Note over Client,MQProducer: 等待1s

    Client->>Redis: 充值3
    Redis->>Redis: GET UEWF_{merchantId}_{userId}
    Redis->>Client: 充值结果3

    Client->>Redis: 零钱锁单请求4
    Redis->>Redis: INCR UEWF_{merchantId}_{userId}
    Redis->>Redis: EXPIRE UEWF_{merchantId}_{userId} 5s
    Redis->>MQProducer: 延迟消息4
    MQProducer-->>MQBroker: 发送消息4
    MQProducer->>Client:锁单结果4

    Note over Client,MQProducer: 等待1s

    Client->>Redis: 充值4
    Redis->>Redis: GET UEWF_{merchantId}_{userId}
    Redis->>Client: 充值结果4

    Client->>Redis: 零钱锁单请求5
    Redis->>Redis: INCR UEWF_{merchantId}_{userId}
    Redis->>Redis: EXPIRE UEWF_{merchantId}_{userId} 5s
    Redis->>MQProducer: 延迟消息5
    MQProducer-->>MQBroker: 发送消息5
    MQProducer->>Client:锁单结果5

    Note over Client,MQProducer: 等待1s

    MQBroker-->>MQConsumer: 消费消息1
    MQConsumer->>Redis: 业务处理
    Redis->>Redis: REMOVE UEWF_{merchantId}_{userId}

    Client->>Redis: 充值5
    Redis->>Redis: GET UEWF_{merchantId}_{userId}
    Redis->>Client: 充值结果5

    Client->>Redis: 零钱锁单请求6
    Redis->>Redis: INCR UEWF_{merchantId}_{userId}
    Redis->>Redis: EXPIRE UEWF_{merchantId}_{userId} 5s
    Redis->>MQProducer: 延迟消息6
    MQProducer-->>MQBroker: 发送消息6
    MQProducer->>Client:锁单结果6

    Note over Client,MQProducer: 等待1s
    MQBroker-->>MQConsumer: 消费消息2
    MQConsumer->>Redis: 业务处理
    Redis->>Redis: REMOVE UEWF_{merchantId}_{userId}

    Client->>Redis: 充值6
    Redis->>Redis: GET UEWF_{merchantId}_{userId}
    Redis->>Client: 充值结果6

    Client->>Redis: 零钱锁单请求7
    Redis->>Redis: INCR UEWF_{merchantId}_{userId}
    Redis->>Redis: EXPIRE UEWF_{merchantId}_{userId} 5s
    Redis->>MQProducer: 延迟消息7
    MQProducer-->>MQBroker: 发送消息7
    MQProducer->>Client:锁单结果7

    Note over Client,MQProducer: 等待1s
    MQBroker-->>MQConsumer: 消费消息3
    MQConsumer->>Redis: 业务处理
    Redis->>Redis: REMOVE UEWF_{merchantId}_{userId}

    Client->>Redis: 充值7
    Redis->>Redis: GET UEWF_{merchantId}_{userId}
    Redis->>Client: 充值结果7

    Note over Client,MQProducer: 等待5s
    MQBroker-->>MQConsumer: 消费消息4
    MQConsumer->>Redis: 业务处理
    Redis->>Redis: REMOVE UEWF_{merchantId}_{userId}
    MQBroker-->>MQConsumer: 消费消息5
    MQConsumer->>Redis: 业务处理
    Redis->>Redis: REMOVE UEWF_{merchantId}_{userId}
    MQBroker-->>MQConsumer: 消费消息6
    MQConsumer->>Redis: 业务处理
    Redis->>Redis: REMOVE UEWF_{merchantId}_{userId}
    MQBroker-->>MQConsumer: 消费消息7
    MQConsumer->>Redis: 业务处理
    Redis->>Redis: REMOVE UEWF_{merchantId}_{userId}

    Redis-->>Redis Listener: 过期监听

    Client->>Redis: 充值8
    Redis->>Redis: GET UEWF_{merchantId}_{userId}
    Redis->>Client: 充值结果8
